eightball-cutthroat-restored-player = Foul penalty: ball { $ball } is restored for { $player }.
eightball-cutthroat-illegal-ball-restored-you = Ball { $ball } returns because you pocketed it or drove it off the table on an illegal shot.
eightball-cutthroat-illegal-ball-restored-player = Ball { $ball } returns because { $player } pocketed it or drove it off the table on an illegal shot.
eightball-cutthroat-eliminated-you = You are eliminated because all your protected balls are down.
eightball-cutthroat-eliminated-player = { $player } is eliminated because all protected balls are down.
eightball-cutthroat-reinstated-you = You return to the game because one of your protected balls was restored.
